#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:76
msgid ""
"PhiTeX viewer WebSocket page hashes and per-glyph origins with a character-"
"accurate Ctrl+click fast path, an AI-edit PDF diff view with change "
"navigation, a redesigned Git sidebar with scrolling lists and a standard-"
"window side-by-side diff, plus HIG, shortcut, translation and build-"
"resilience fixes."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:81
msgid ""
"An embedded AI agent terminal based on VTE, a redesigned Git sidebar panel "
"with separate commit and push operations, hiding all AI entries when the "
"agent is disabled, glyph-rectangle based PDF click-to-source with paragraph "
"snapping, and many SyncTeX, preview and build-pipeline fixes."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:86
msgid ""
"PhiTeX persistent watch sessions with real-time incremental preview, a "
"PhiTeX version and update page in preferences, a tri-state build timer, line-"
"number drag selection, a whitelisted color scheme grid, and synctex line "
"numbers corrected against the PDF text."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:91
msgid ""
"Fixes for a session-restore segfault with untitled documents, command "
"palette focus loss and the Ctrl+/ comment shortcut; tab context menus and "
"several lists and dialogs moved to standard libadwaita widgets; line-number "
"drag selection."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:96
msgid ""
"Stable preview sidebar sizing when selecting text, icons by completion item "
"kind, reduced-animation fixes for the search bar and replace row, and "
"refreshed symbolic icons."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:101
msgid ""
"A \"Reduce animations\" preference, stutter-free sidebar toggling and gutter "
"rendering, hot-path performance work, a status-bar build result indicator, "
"and the Windows portable build moved to MSYS2 UCRT64."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:106
msgid ""
"Crash fixes found by static analysis (shortcut capture, build log context "
"menus, AI fix execution), an operable interpreter-missing dialog, and "
"segmented-control state fixes."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:111
msgid ""
"TikZ snippet live preview, math formula hover preview, real-time chktex "
"linting, smart quotes, tab pinning, unused and duplicate label detection, "
"and panel switching unified on libadwaita segmented controls."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:116
msgid ""
"All seven bundled translations completed, and the light seam along the page "
"edges of the application icon fixed."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:121
msgid ""
"App-wide interface zoom, a new book-style application icon, centered SyncTeX "
"jumps, and lower memory use after builds."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:126
msgid ""
"Text selection and a magnifier in the preview, Git integration, an agent "
"terminal entry, and multi-cursor editing out of the experimental stage."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:131
msgid ""
"Remaining dialogs rebuilt on standard libadwaita widgets, with several long-"
"standing bugs fixed."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:136
msgid ""
"Opening documents, restoring sessions and parsing bibliography files are now "
"orders of magnitude faster."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:141
msgid ""
"Command palette, table and matrix generators, a bibliography manager, user "
"snippets and an interactive example project."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:146
msgid ""
"Renamed to NeoSetzer with a new icon; LaTeX-aware spell checking, image "
"insertion, and automated Debian, Windows and macOS builds."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:151
msgid ""
"Theme quick switcher in the menu, rebuilt build log and autocomplete popups, "
"and sharper gutter rendering."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:156
msgid ""
"Native Windows support, with cross-platform paths, terminals and packaging."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:161
msgid ""
"Build diagnostics highlighted in the gutter, per-page preview layout with "
"page badges, and begin/end syntax highlighting."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:166
msgid ""
"Build pipeline reworked on a thread pool, an undo depth limit, and several "
"GTK4 compatibility fixes."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:171
msgid ""
"First-run tutorial, bookmarks, multi-cursor editing, code folding commands "
"and a global exception handler."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:176
msgid ""
"AI fix for build errors, a detached PDF preview window, session snapshots "
"and an improved document wizard."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:181
msgid ""
"Clicking in the PDF preview now jumps to the exact source character, and "
"search and replace share a single toolbar."
msgstr ""

#: data/org.cvfosammmm.Setzer.metainfo.xml.in:186
msgid ""
"Sidebar and help panel interaction refactored, a PDF page jump entry added, "
"and editor settings merged into the appearance page."
msgstr ""

